[{"title":"黄姬水得遥字","author":"朱曰藩","text":"一勺名泉手自调，石筵香烬夜遥遥。\n半生寤寐虚双鲤，万里容辉挹片绡。\n学海竞夸天阁秘，春心欲托帝巫招。\n芳樽潦倒郎官舍，江芷皋兰雨未消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5559,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭第得乡字","author":"朱曰藩","text":"先朝金马重文章，三十余年适瘴乡。\n共羡史迁飙石室，谁怜贾傅老潇湘。\n披图月就金陵堕，飞梦云牵玉垒长。\n方外游踪元不系，欲将瓢笠问江阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5560,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盛时泰得题字","author":"朱曰藩","text":"人日寒多雨意低，冶城春色柳条齐。\n梅开东阁斜穿槛，潮过西州乱入溪。\n天末丰神劳梦寐，壁间丘壑有诗题。\n碧云回首人千里，巴水东流猿夜啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金大舆得怜字","author":"朱曰藩","text":"人日梅花自可怜，折来谁为寄西川。\n八行欲附铜鱼使，四海争谣白雪篇。\n滇水山川增气色，锦江花柳隔风烟。\n何时一棹穿巴峡，得就扬雄问《太玄》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱曰藩寄升庵先生一首","author":"朱曰藩","text":"亭花落尽鹧鸪飞，吉甫台边春事稀。\n锦水毓华添丽藻，禺山金碧有光辉。\n僰中僮隶传书至，煎上人家沽酒归。\n笑挈一壶江浦去，轻红刚值荔枝肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扬州感兴","author":"金銮","text":"迢递古扬州，重来异昔游。\n春风吹酒幔，日暮上歌楼。\n梦觉翻疑雨，愁多不待秋。\n翩翩征雁起，依旧向沙头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜宿朱少府小楼感旧","author":"金銮","text":"故人复相聚，已是十年过。\n纵使为欢处，其如伤老何。\n晓钟寒报早，春雨夜闻多。\n感慨高阳侣，临风发啸歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇明寺答水云禅师","author":"金銮","text":"野寺临晴昼，园花照暮春。\n夕阳千树绕，芳草一江邻。\n有客来何处，逢人寄此身。\n远公能好事，头白更相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊淮上","author":"金銮","text":"愁轻游冶兴，老重别离情。\n野戍寒更尽，河桥春水生。\n断云疏雁影，残月乱鸡声。\n明发应千里，萧萧过楚城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴七泉还歙","author":"金銮","text":"离家岁将暮，归路雨初晴。\n水阔空江冷，风高落叶轻。\n锦囊倾内史，白璧报双成。\n好试千金马，清霜白草平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5568,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京师抵家值除夕","author":"金銮","text":"又见一年尽，初从万里回。\n青灯笑儿女，白首恋尊罍。\n故业琴书在，余寒鼓角催。\n翻然忘老去，亦自喜春来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5569,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登沧州城","author":"金銮","text":"渤海高人去，仙台古迹存。\n风沙吹不断，天地与同昏。\n野水添新绿，空烟集暮村。\n故园桑柘里，怅望欲销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳堤","author":"金銮","text":"春江水正平，密树听啼莺。\n十里笼睛苑，千条锁故营。\n雨香飞燕促，风暖落花轻。\n更欲劳攀折，年年还自生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日","author":"金銮","text":"长至履微阳，江城百事荒。\n野天悬薄日，残叶堕浓霜。\n失路故人绝，入门新酒香。\n醉歌还起舞，儿女笑成行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独夜","author":"金銮","text":"小窗成独卧，落月满残更。\n双眼苦难合，孤灯耿自明。\n林喧疏鸟梦，霜冷咽鸡声。\n白发知多少，和愁夜夜生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漂母祠","author":"金銮","text":"古渡临祠庙，长淮接市门。\n旌旗摇白日，风雨锁黄昏。\n贫贱求知己，荣华少故恩。\n湖边逢牧竖，犹自说王孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"通津驿","author":"金銮","text":"野泊初经夜，舟移独避滩。\n风轻云气薄，月静水光寒。\n且恨辞家久，休歌行路难。\n前途何必问，明日是长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞","author":"金銮","text":"跃马走胡尘，将军不顾身。\n黄沙一万里，赤帜五千人。\n天子犹称汉，匈奴岂畏秦。\n不知苏属国，何日画麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石湖","author":"金銮","text":"东风载兰桨，二月下横塘。\n芳草野湖碧，落花春店香。\n醉呼吴市酒，老作楚人狂。\n良会催迟暮，青楼尚理妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游徐太傅园","author":"金銮","text":"乍起日犹长，重来暑渐藏。\n鸡鸣隔林屋，人语出藩墙。\n杨柳晚风静，芙蓉秋水香。\n王孙多乐事，扶醉拥笙簧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凭虚阁酬秋厓方丈","author":"金銮","text":"古城迢递俯清溪，高阁凭虚引御堤。\n凉雨乍收千树净，夕烟初起万家迷。\n空垂白发悲前事，重对青山忆旧题。\n犹自乐游虚故苑，碧桃飞尽草萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北河道中","author":"金銮","text":"丛台北向通燕谷，曲渚西流绕蓟门。\n归鸟乱啼原上树，夕阳多照水边村。\n因悲俗吏趋三辅，曾有新诗寄陆浑。\n岁岁别来春又暮，几回芳草怨王孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀天界珵师","author":"金銮","text":"三年不见苇航公，潦倒江湖鬓若蓬。\n地远每怜踪迹异，时违应念甲庚同。\n惯牵短梦南山雨，频拟疏钟北寺风。\n何日重携老居士，石床秋藓坐谈空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮上送唐池屿别驾赴部","author":"金銮","text":"与君南北漫相期，惆怅东风楚水涯。\n万里辞家身是梦，三年作郡口为碑。\n重将直道干明主，肯负初心答故知。\n芳草接天春望迥，一尊相对复何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊盂城驿简仲辋庄","author":"金銮","text":"盂城驿口射阳西，水国风烟似五溪。\n万井落花春后发，几家垂柳雨中齐。\n时临野店炊晨黍，渐入荒村报午鸡。\n见说辋川多胜事，经过原许一相携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安道中寄怀诸旧","author":"金銮","text":"故岭重经枫叶凋，族怀肃索伴归樵。\n冰霜在道无千里，肌骨侵寒已半消。\n石面乱云随马度，树头残雨逐人飘。\n翻思前夜溪亭别，窈窕清商酒一瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入春寄黄高园少府兼柬群从","author":"金銮","text":"风流歌曲许人传，群季皆称谢惠连。\n一笑相留如昨日，几时奉别又新年。\n黄萝晓带溪头雨，白岳晴通陇上烟。\n拟待扬州二三月，翠红香软泛湖船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛首","author":"金銮","text":"先皇曾此驻龙旂，一夜空山拥六师。\n春鸟尚思巡幸处，野花不似乐游时。\n遥闻寺外江声落，倒见天边塔影垂。\n若问南朝昔年事，废原荒井有残碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴","author":"金銮","text":"天际浮云入思深，物情生态看销沉。\n南朝台榭多于昔，东晋风流不似今。\n背岭夕阳明远烧，隔江霜叶下高林。\n西风兰芷还堪把，拟向孤琴结短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜客和阳僧舍","author":"金銮","text":"独煨余火向天涯，僧舍逢春有所思。\n百里是家归未得，半生如梦醒何时。\n空堂坐久残年逼，短角声乾子夜迟。\n遥想清灯对杯酒，小窗儿女忆还期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵留别吴虹山","author":"金銮","text":"北风江上雪晴时，远道逢君醉不辞。\n临别更留三夜话，相知已是十年期。\n断云落雁声犹切，斜月疏窗影渐移。\n久客不须伤岁暮，五湖归思满天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日企斋朱少府松窗徐公子见访未暇展待闻别有佳约诗以答之","author":"金銮","text":"远承华盖及衡门，日午相携到日昏。\n白发自应忘县长，青袍谁复识王孙。\n更因夜月留何处，忍对春风负此尊。\n传道城南剩佳丽，小词翻出寄桃根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"金銮","text":"还忆去年辞白下，却怜今夕在黄州。\n空江积雪添双鬓，细雨疏灯共一楼。\n世难久拚鱼雁绝，家贫常为稻粱谋。\n归来故旧多凋丧，愁对东风感壮游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采菱曲","author":"金銮","text":"采菱秋水旁，惊起双鸳鸯。\n独自唱歌去，风吹荇带长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀","author":"金銮","text":"怅望隔江云，春来不见君。\n歌声与流水，俱在梦中闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"银河","author":"金銮","text":"月出影渐没，夜深光倍明。\n鹊毛看又尽，填到几时平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听胡琴","author":"金銮","text":"悲语发哀弦，声声道野仙。\n谁将胡地乐，留作汉人传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门","author":"金銮","text":"阖闾城外花如烟，洞庭山下水连天。\n安得弄花缘水去，与君同上木兰船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感旧","author":"金銮","text":"北风吹雪暗江城，岁暮天涯共此情。\n试向尊前弹一曲，琵琶犹是别来声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"金銮","text":"春雨春风花意狂，谁家溪上浣花娘。\n水流不管花心乱，花落能教水面香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春城曲","author":"金銮","text":"雨余芳草远萋萋，春暖游人信马蹄。\n日暮画楼归去晚，落花香里路东西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄吴厚丘","author":"金銮","text":"黄金散作买花资，白首谁能恋故知。\n同作孟尝门下客，西风吹鬓独归时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"金銮","text":"御水中流外不知，尚遗红叶旧题诗。\n纵然不放轻流出，犹是君恩未了时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与张玄湖夜饮醉归用韵","author":"何良俊","text":"总为繁华住旧京，尊前花朵照人清。\n杨枝斗舞全无力，桃叶传歌惯有情。\n阅世堪悲唯逝水，唤人行乐是流莺。\n莫辞酩酊归来晚，残月依依下石城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次前韵","author":"何良俊","text":"行乐难逢在晋京，人生谁得俟河清。\n即教老去难忘酒，纵使贫来不废情。\n粉黛连宵皆好月，管弦逐日有娇莺。\n天公乞与百年活，肯向西方觅化城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日花前听李节筝歌作张王屋黄质山每夸余以歌馆之乐书此贻之并要和篇戏呈紫岗兄","author":"何良俊","text":"瘦鹤支离病客身，黄莺娇小帝城春。\n花前莫遣清尊歇，头上应添白发新。\n纵饮已忘身外事，当歌且惜眼中人。\n秦淮花月如天上，几欲乘槎一问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送潘苎乡南还","author":"何良俊","text":"吴门怅别动经年，一度思君一黯然。\n昔日歌钟成逝水，旧游池馆荡飞烟。\n春风白发期同醉，夜雨青灯忆共眠。\n最是欲留留不住，归心相逐下平川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙卯八月余觞客青溪之上坐有李节鸣筝质山咏二绝句次其韵 其一","author":"何良俊","text":"虚馆鸣筝秋正清，停弦掩抑最关情。\n当年爱杀恒司马，赏会由来是此声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙卯八月余觞客青溪之上坐有李节鸣筝质山咏二绝句次其韵 其二","author":"何良俊","text":"哀音袅袅出重帏，羁客仙仙思欲飞。\n弦滑酒香花正好，不辞零露夜沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盛云浦集客文文水张王屋独不见召旬日后以文水原韵索和书此嘲之","author":"何良俊","text":"拙贻堂上题诗客，尽日穷吟作么声。\n闲杀青溪老居士，冶城东畔不教行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"研山中翰许歌者李生以名香久不见至书此戏之","author":"何良俊","text":"新声宛转动梁尘，歌罢谁云不断魂。\n一片好香消不得，明珠十斛为何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听李节弹筝和文文水韵","author":"何良俊","text":"汩汩寒泉泻玉筝，泠泠标格映清冰。\n愁中为鼓秋风曲，不负移家住秣陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盛仲交原倡","author":"何良俊","text":"酒清香蔼夜搊筝，弦上凉生六月冰。\n但许风流擅南馆，不教飞梦绕西陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文休承和","author":"何良俊","text":"泠泠寒玉泻秦筝，片片清声似断冰。\n一曲浑疑李凭在，不知秋旅是金陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张玄超","author":"何良俊","text":"披帷月底理鸣筝，哀调澄于镜里冰。\n试使楚王闻一曲，可怜应不数安陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄圣生","author":"何良俊","text":"月照高楼弹玉筝，泠泠飞峡泻寒冰。\n羁人一听阳春曲，不畏秋风客秣陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其一","author":"何良俊","text":"城市总居图画里，江山镇绕帝王宫。\n秦人漫自夸韦曲，越客何须说剡中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其二","author":"何良俊","text":"即遣娇歌和野禽，更教红袖拂青林。\n自从谢傅东山后，传得风流直至今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其三","author":"何良俊","text":"融融暖日正曛人，澹澹和风不动尘。\n况是城南家又近，争教若个不寻春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其四","author":"何良俊","text":"扑翠蛾儿称意匀，杏红衫子逐时新。\n装梳莫讶朝来别，无奈桃花解妒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其五","author":"何良俊","text":"万片夭桃迎笑靥，千条弱柳斗纤腰。\n潘妃死后芳魂在，散作城南一段娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其六","author":"何良俊","text":"双眉如黛发如云，背立踟蹰避使君。\n忽觉香风来陌上，回身微动石榴裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白下春游曲七首 其七","author":"何良俊","text":"结子成阴积渐多，春光一去再来无。\n明朝更欲城南去，自掣金钗付酒胡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日皇甫司勋见过余出小鬟以筝琶侑觞司勋为赋三绝句率尔奉答 其一","author":"何良俊","text":"灯下曾观舞丽华，小庭亦复沸筝琶。\n近来此乐无人解，独有牛家与白家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日皇甫司勋见过余出小鬟以筝琶侑觞司勋为赋三绝句率尔奉答 其二","author":"何良俊","text":"歌珠历落本清圆，更遣流泉乱拂弦。\n好取使君留一顾，故将误曲唱当筵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日皇甫司勋见过余出小鬟以筝琶侑觞司勋为赋三绝句率尔奉答 其三","author":"何良俊","text":"帘同夏亶真成陋，床类杨褒亦太寒。\n不是窈娘容绝世，何妨日日借人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵吊古八首 其一","author":"何良俊","text":"汉季平分三国，孙吴元占东方。\n堪笑当时王浚，与人闲管兴亡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵吊古八首 其二","author":"何良俊","text":"风物元推晋宋，江山又属齐梁。\n今夜弈棋收局，明朝傀儡排场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵吊古八首 其三","author":"何良俊","text":"车兵绝多膂力，黄奴全没心肝。\n可惜金昌致踣，输他醉死长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵吊古八首 其四","author":"何良俊","text":"夹坐酣饮押客，擘笺短歌丽人。\n此事岂关贵势，只应抛与闲身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵吊古八首 其五","author":"何良俊","text":"齐苑晨登紫阁，宋宫夜逐羊车。\n何似日斜散步，一壶随分谁家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵吊古八首 其六","author":"何良俊","text":"周处台前草长，莫愁湖上云深。\n不惜英雄代谢，独怜红粉消沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5630,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]